WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.001 --> 00:00:03.494
The score is in the middle, both teams are on court.

2
00:00:03.544 --> 00:00:07.334
Team A serves. Rally won by A: tap "Point A".

3
00:00:07.384 --> 00:00:10.212
Before each serve, tap "Start rally".

4
00:00:10.262 --> 00:00:13.492
Team B wins the rally: "Point B". B now serves and rotates.

5
00:00:13.542 --> 00:00:20.542
Each rally: "Start rally", then the point for the winner.

6
00:00:23.395 --> 00:00:26.023
Wrong point? Tap "Undo".

7
00:00:26.073 --> 00:00:28.730
"Confirm undo": tap "Yes". The last point is gone.

8
00:00:28.780 --> 00:00:32.608
With a keyboard: "Match" → "Options".

9
00:00:32.658 --> 00:00:39.658
Turn on "Keyboard shortcuts". "Configure keys" lists the keys.

10
00:00:40.057 --> 00:00:46.310
Enter starts the rally, A and L give the point to the left or right team.

11
00:00:46.360 --> 00:00:49.125
Under each team: points (P), set won (W), substitutions (S), time-outs (T).
